0..68 Comment "// A module is a model: `pack M at Model(T)` packs a module ascribed"
69..147 Comment "// `Model(T)` as the bundled record its theory states, the code of each sort\'s"
148..220 Comment "// type and each member the module gives. Two counters modulo three, one"
221..298 Comment "// counting up and one counting down read negated, are modules of one theory;"
299..373 Comment "// packed, they are related along negation as models, and a consumer reads"
374..404 Comment "// both alike by construction."
